    "description": "Workshop, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. The kingdom's workshop for everything that isn't wood (stage 6b). Stone hall with an open front bay. L1 the stone bench (crafting table, grindstone, raw stone pile); L2 the kiln (stonecutter, glass windows, brick kiln with two furnaces and a stack, sand and clay heaps); L3 the forge (anvil, blast furnace, quench tub, ore and coal lean-to, banner, lamp post). Stonecutter, anvil and blast furnace are not builder-tested yet. Not yet builder-tested: anvil, black_carpet, blast_furnace, brick_slab, cauldron, clay, coal_block, cornflower, dandelion, fern, iron_bars, raw_copper_block, raw_iron_block, red_sand, red_wall_banner, sand, stone_brick_slab, stonecutter. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern, item, sign_text, water_cauldron.",
